{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">施明早前離世，其身後事卻意外引發家庭風波。李泳豪曾對外爆出，因哥哥李泳漢未有告知施明的安葬地點，導致他與父親李家鼎一直未能親身前往拜祭亡母，事件一度鬧得沸沸揚揚。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">今日（18日），李泳豪終於在社交平台向大家帶來好消息，透露</span>終於找到亡母的骨灰位<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">，並於今早順利完成上位儀式。他特別上載了一張與媽媽施明的溫馨舊合照，字裏行間充滿對外界伸出援手的感激之情。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"drift_greg_1789704813_3988655518826796619_1417613565.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026bg4HO70UH01789713711.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"drift_greg_1789704813_3988655518826796619_1417613565.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">豪仔發文剖白心聲：「感謝在這些日子裏有很多熱心、善心人的幫忙，在他們關懷及協助下終於找到我媽媽的骨灰位並確實在今早已上位，衷心感謝你們，無言感激。」如今終於能讓媽媽有一個安靜的安息之所，相信豪仔與鼎爺終於可以真正放下心頭大石。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"drift_greg_1756534458_3710402426815221891_1417613565.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026tDSBm2bI8c1789713712.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"drift_greg_1756534458_3710402426815221891_1417613565.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-18 下午12.46.36.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026HNp9FcGaPx1789713711.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-18 下午12.46.36.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T07:17:30.175074+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}